<strong>Readles</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;">The museum, located in Dubai Mall Zabeel, combines magic, stories, and modern technology to create fun learning adventures for the whole family. Inspired by fairy tales from around the world, each zone lets kids see, touch, and play with their favorite heroes brought to life through lights, sounds, and digital art.</p>

<p style="margin:0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;"><a target="_blank" href="https://readles.com/" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Multiple dates, Tickets start from 99AED + VAT</a></p>

