        />
        <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><a href="https://www.zomato.com/dubai/bkry-al-quoz" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Bkry</a></strong> in Alserkal Avenue is a trendy bakery-café known for inventive pastries, specialty coffee, and an all-day dining menu. The open bakery concept lets guests watch breads and croissants being crafted using house-processed grains and creative flavours like miso caramel and candied citrus. Popular picks include almond croissants, Pantone French toast, and salmon cream-cheese bagels.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><em>Pro tip:</em></strong><em> pair the cinnamon roll with fresh coffee.</em></p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
