<!-- Summary / CTA -->
<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">A clinic in JLT is looking to hire a Filipina nurse or dental assistant to join its team. The role involves assisting dentists during procedures, preparing treatment rooms, sterilising instruments, managing patient records, and supporting general clinic operations. Candidates with or without a licence may apply. Prior dental clinic experience is an advantage, and strong communication and patient-care skills are preferred. The position offers an opportunity to work in a busy outpatient setting.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/medical-healthcare/nurse-healthcare-assistant/2026/3/9/dental-assistant-2-700---e718899225e54f7bbdb06f2bd5b37e41/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here  </strong></a></p>
</mj-text>
