        <mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Cooler UAE weather
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Temperatures are expected to dip slightly across Abu Dhabi and Dubai. Partly cloudy to cloudy skies are forecast through the week, and <a href="https://gulfnews.com/uae/weather/uae-weather-alert-light-rain-across-abu-dhabi-and-dubai-1.500468052" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">possible showers</a> in western, coastal, and northern areas. Temperatures will noticeably drop on Tuesday amid strengthening winds up to 40 km/h; expect rising humidity and potential fog overnight Wednesday into Thursday.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Women in motorsport
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Amna Al Qubaisi will become the <a href="https://gulfnews.com/sport/motorsport/emirati-racer-amna-al-qubaisi-makes-history-1.500467870" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">first woman</a> to compete in the Pro class of the Porsche Carrera Cup Asia in the 2026 season. The 25-year-old Emirati racer, already a trailblazer in regional motorsport, will face a competitive grid of around 30 drivers. The campaign begins at Shanghai International Circuit during the Chinese Grand Prix weekend.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Gold price drop
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Gold prices in Dubai fell sharply, with 24K dropping Dh10 to Dh613.25 per gram. The decline followed a stronger US dollar and <a href="https://www.khaleejtimes.com/business/markets/dubai-gold-price-plunge-dh10-per-gram-march-9" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">fading expectations</a> of interest-rate cuts, pushing global prices below $5,100 per ounce. Other variants: 22K at Dh567.75, 21K Dh544.50. Analysts see short-term consolidation but long-term bullishness if the US-Israel-Iran conflict disrupts trade and fuels inflation.</p>
</mj-text>
